Article 6 When transferring a suspected criminal case to a public security organ, the administrative law enforcement organ shall attach the following materials:
(1) a letter of transfer for the suspected criminal case;
(2) an investigation report on the circumstances of the suspected criminal case;
(3) a list of articles involved in the case;
(4) relevant inspection reports or expert evaluation conclusions; and
(5) other materials related to the suspected crime.
